#. module: l10n_it_intrastat
#: model:report.intrastat.code,description:l10n_it_intrastat.intrastat_category_2014_72281020
msgid ""
"Bars and rods of high-speed steel, not further worked than hot-rolled, hot-"
"drawn or extruded, and hot-rolled, hot-drawn or extruded, not further worked "
