"albacares, Thunnus obesus, Thunnus thynnus, Thunnus orientalis e Thunnus "
"maccoyii)"

#. module: l10n_it_intrastat
#: model:report.intrastat.code,description:l10n_it_intrastat.intrastat_category_2014_03033400
