#. module: l10n_it_intrastat
#: model:report.intrastat.code,description:l10n_it_intrastat.intrastat_category_2014_02072730
msgid ""
"Frozen whole wings, with or without tips, of turkeys of the species "
"domesticus"
msgstr ""
"Ali intere, anche senza punta, di tacchini e tacchine (pollame domestico) "
