msgstr "Frutta del genere Capsicum diverse dai peperoni dolci o pimenti"

#. module: l10n_it_intrastat
#: model:report.intrastat.code,description:l10n_it_intrastat.intrastat_category_2014_08119070
msgid ""
"Fruit of species vaccinium myrtilloides and vaccinium angustifolium, "
