"Mirtilli delle specie Vaccinium myrtilloides e Vaccinium angustifolium, "
"congelati, senza zuccheri"

#. module: l10n_it_intrastat
#: model:report.intrastat.code,description:l10n_it_intrastat.intrastat_category_2014_08129040
msgid ""
"Fruit of species vaccinium myrtillus, provisionally preserved, e.g. by "
"sulphur dioxide gas, in brine, in sulphur water or in other preservative "
