#. module: l10n_it_intrastat
#: model:report.intrastat.code,description:l10n_it_intrastat.intrastat_category_2014_41079190
msgid ""
"Full grains leather \"incl. parchment-dressed leather\", unsplit, of the "
"portions, strips or sheets of  hides and skins of bovine \"incl. buffalo\" "
