"scamosciati, verniciati o laccati e cuoi e pelli metallizzati)"

#. module: l10n_it_intrastat
#: model:report.intrastat.code,description:l10n_it_intrastat.intrastat_category_2014_41044111
msgid ""
"Full grains leather, unsplit and grain splits leather of East India kip, "
"without hair on, whole, whether or not the heads and legs have been removed, "
