"compressione)"

#. module: l10n_it_intrastat
#: model:report.intrastat.code,description:l10n_it_intrastat.intrastat_category_2014_84212100
msgid "Machinery and apparatus for filtering or purifying water"
msgstr "Apparecchi per filtrare o depurare l'acqua"

#. module: l10n_it_intrastat
#: model:report.intrastat.code,description:l10n_it_intrastat.intrastat_category_2014_84012000
msgid ""
"Machinery and apparatus for isotopic separation and parts thereof, n.e.s. "
"[Euratom]"
msgstr ""
"Macchine ed apparecchi per la separazione isotopica, e loro parti (Euratom)"

#. module: l10n_it_intrastat
#: model:report.intrastat.code,description:l10n_it_intrastat.intrastat_category_2014_84688000
msgid ""
"Machinery and apparatus for welding, not gas-operated (excl. electric "
"machines and apparatus of heading 8515)"
msgstr ""
"Macchine ed apparecchi per la saldatura (non a gas) (escl. macchine ed "
"apparecchi elettrici od operanti con laser o con altri fasci di luce o di "
"fotoni, con ultrasuoni, con fasci di elettroni, per impulsi magnetici o a "
"getto di plasma)"

#. module: l10n_it_intrastat
#: model:report.intrastat.code,description:l10n_it_intrastat.intrastat_category_2014_84748010
msgid "Machinery for agglomerating, shaping or moulding ceramic paste"
msgstr "Macchine per agglomerare, formare o modellare le paste ceramiche"

#. module: l10n_it_intrastat
#: model:report.intrastat.code,description:l10n_it_intrastat.intrastat_category_2014_84748090
msgid ""
"Machinery for agglomerating, shaping or moulding solid mineral fuels, "
"unhardened cements, plastering materials and other mineral products in "
"powder or paste form, and machines for forming foundry moulds of sand (excl. "
