#. module: l10n_it_intrastat
#: model:report.intrastat.code,description:l10n_it_intrastat.intrastat_category_2014_32041600
msgid ""
"Synthetic organic reactive dyes; preparations based on synthetic organic "
"reactive dyes of a kind used to dye fabrics or produce colorant preparations "
