"quelli delle voci 4802 o 4803)"

#. module: l10n_it_intrastat
#: model:report.intrastat.code,description:l10n_it_intrastat.intrastat_category_2014_48041119
msgid ""
"Unbleached kraftliner, uncoated, in rolls of a width > 36 cm, containing >= "
